              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Buckwheat Queen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Close to the classic Amatriciana, this is an easy, fast, and simple recipe. I felt there was too much wine, though. Also, I followed the instructions by simmering the al dente pasta for 2 minutes in the sauce. It’s unconventional but interesting. However, to keep the pasta al dente, you need to keep an eye on it.",
