            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "C M"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Though I had to use salt pork instead of panchetta, this was the most authentic amatraciana, the flavors were clean and simple. LOVED IT, though I may have to try a little bechemel topping, that sounded gooood.",
